"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T05:04:26-08:00","id":39913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baron Samedi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/39604-actual-play-dead-men-and-sinners?p=39861#post39861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quite good, thanks for posting it. The icon design there is an especially nice touch, I must say.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! It was a blast to run! I'm kinda proud of the logo, though I stole a lot of parts for it. :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T09:55:59-08:00","id":40043,"title":"","content":"Wow, definitely cool to see how it all played out. Thanks for posting this up Max. Much appreciated! I like the Deadman's Locker dominion. That's a creative use of Old Laws for a Pirate themed treasure hunt.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm not sure why but for some reason that little part about the krewe, not being a krewe yet makes me laugh every time I read it. This ship's crew, is a krewe (well not a krewe yet but still a crew nonetheless). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Probably watched too much Arrested Development; &quot;Bob Loblaw's Law Blog&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":237,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/237-dagcon-faraday","user":"Dagcon Faraday","date":". 12-31-2013, 01:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/237-dagcon-faraday","name":"Dagcon Faraday","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T12:33:24-08:00","id":40106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dagcon Faraday</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/39604-actual-play-dead-men-and-sinners?p=40043#post40043\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow, definitely cool to see how it all played out. Thanks for posting this up Max. Much appreciated! I like the Deadman's Locker dominion. That's a creative use of Old Laws for a Pirate themed treasure hunt.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm not sure why but for some reason that little part about the krewe, not being a krewe yet makes me laugh every time I read it. This ship's crew, is a krewe (well not a krewe yet but still a crew nonetheless). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Probably watched too much Arrested Development; &quot;Bob Loblaw's Law Blog&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks for the comments!<br /> <br /> Hah, they didn't use the Krewe binding ritual yet, it was the next thing to do, but he had to stop. But they are a crew already. It will get in a lot of confusion (The ship's crew krewe\u2026). I told you Geist has a lot of elements of a pirate game already. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}